text: ['({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal an Elf card from your hand or pay {3}.\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token for each Elf you control.', 'Cycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Incinerator, you may have it deal X damage to target creature, where X is the number of Goblins on the battlefield.', 'Cycling {2}{G}{G} ({2}{G}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Strider, Elf creatures get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Echo {1}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Mogg War Marshal enters the battlefield or dies, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.', 'First strike\n{R}, {T}: Attacking creatures gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Forests you control are 1/1 green Elf creatures that are still lands.\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice an Elf: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Forgotten Cave enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}.\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Goblin Cohort can't attack unless you've cast a creature spell this turn.", 'Goblin spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\nGoblins you control have haste.', "Haste\nReckless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Goblins on the battlefield.", 'Haste\nSacrifice a Goblin: Clickslither gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nWhen Goblin Ringleader enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Goblin cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Other Elves you control get +1/+1.\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Protection from red\nTap five untapped Goblins you control: Skirk Fire Marshal deals 10 damage to each creature and each player.', "Return an Elf you control to its owner's hand: Untap target creature. Activate only once each turn.", 'Sacrifice Elvish Eulogist: You gain 1 life for each Elf card in your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Emberwilde Augur: It deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. Activate only during your upkeep.', 'Sacrifice Mogg Fanatic: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice Moonglove Extract: It deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Add {R}.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Skirk Shaman can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or red creatures.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Tap five untapped Elves you control: Create a 7/7 green Elemental creature token with trample.', 'Tarfire deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', "Trample\nHeedless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Elves on the battlefield.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\nWhen Sylvan Messenger enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Elf cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.", 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G}.\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'When Elvish Harbinger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Elf card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Goblin Matron enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Goblin card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Wirewood Herald dies, you may search your library for an Elf card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "Whenever Skirk Drill Sergeant or another Goblin dies, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a Goblin permanent card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", 'Whenever another Goblin you control becomes blocked, sacrifice it. If you do, it deals 4 damage to each creature blocking it.\nSacrifice two Mountains: Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Whenever another Goblin you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may have Boggart Shenanigans deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Whenever you cast an Elf spell, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', "You may exile two green cards from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nAllosaurus Rider's power and toughness are each equal to 1 plus the number of lands you control.", '{4}, {T}, Discard your hand: Draw a card for each creature you control.', '{7}{G}: Stonewood Invoker gets +5/+5 until end of turn.', '{7}{R}: Flamewave Invoker deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Tar Pitcher deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{R}, {T}: Target Goblin creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{G}, {T}: Untap target Elf.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.']
